sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant SP as SearchPage
    participant APS as AudioPlayerService
    participant SM as SourceManager
    participant KS as KugouSource
    participant SIGN as KugouSign
    participant KG as 酷狗接口(gateway/krcs)
    participant NS as NeteaseSource
    participant AP as just_audio
    participant AH as AudioPlayerHandler
    participant NL as NotificationLyricService
    participant IS as IslandService
    participant OS as 系统通知/灵动岛

    Note over U,OS: 前置：用户在设置页把音源切为「酷狗概念版」并已录入 token/userid

    U->>SP: 关键词搜索「周杰伦」
    SP->>SM: source (kugou)
    SM->>KS: search(keyword, limit)
    KS->>SIGN: complexSearchSign(params)
    SIGN-->>KS: signature
    KS->>KG: GET complexsearch.kugou.com/v2/search/song
    alt 主接口失败
        KS->>KG: GET mobilecdn.kugou.com/api/v3/search/song (无签名兜底)
    end
    KG-->>KS: songs[] (hash/album_id/album_audio_id)
    KS-->>SP: List~SongModel~ (source=kugou)
    SP-->>U: 展示结果

    U->>SP: 点击某首播放
    SP->>APS: play(song{source:kugou})
    APS->>APS: final seq = ++_playSeq  (竞态序号)
    APS->>APS: state = loading; currentSong = song
    APS->>SM: sourceFor(kugou)
    SM-->>APS: KugouSource
    APS->>KS: getSongUrl(song)
    KS->>SIGN: urlKey(hash, mid, userid)
    SIGN-->>KS: key
    KS->>KG: GET gateway.kugou.com/v3/url (Header x-router: tracker.kugou.com)
    alt 返回 play_url
        KG-->>KS: url (HTTP/HTTPS)
        KS-->>APS: url
    else 需VIP / 凭证失效 / 无版权 / 网络异常
        KG-->>KS: 空或错误
        APS->>SM: withFallback(song, ...)
        SM->>NS: getSongUrl(song)
        NS-->>SM: 网易云 url
        SM-->>APS: url (回退成功)
    end
    APS->>APS: if (seq != _playSeq) return  // 丢弃过期结果
    APS->>AP: setAudioSource(url).play()
    AP-->>APS: playing

    APS->>KS: getLyrics(song)
    KS->>KG: GET krcs.kugou.com/search?hash=...
    KG-->>KS: id + accesskey
    KS->>KG: GET lyrics.kugou.com/download?fmt=lrc&charset=utf8
    KG-->>KS: base64(LRC)
    KS-->>APS: lrcText
    APS->>APS: _parseLrc -> _lyrics; _updateCurrentLyric

    loop positionStream（每次 position 更新）
        AP-->>APS: position
        APS->>APS: _updateCurrentLyric(position)
        alt 当前歌词行文本发生变化
            APS-->>AH: onLyricChanged(line)
            AH->>NL: feed(line)
            NL->>NL: 去抖 + 节流(<=2 次/秒)
            alt 开关开启且文本不同
                NL-->>AH: onSubtitleChanged(line)
                AH->>AH: mediaItem.add(artist = line)  (副标题=歌词)
                AH-->>OS: audio_service 更新 MediaStyle 通知
                opt 小米且能力检测通过
                    AH->>IS: applyFocus({title, content:line})
                    IS->>OS: 反射 recoverBuilder + miui.focus.param 重发
                end
            else 开关关闭 / 非小米 / 未授权 / 无歌词
                NL->>NL: 静默跳过（不影响播放）
            end
        end
    end
